{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>51歲日本旅遊達人杜如風過去因病暴肥，近日卻在社交平台大曬激瘦自拍，整個人猶如紙片人般單薄。她在短短數月內憑藉 …</p><p></p>\n<p>51歲日本旅遊達人杜如風過去因病暴肥，近日卻在社交平台大曬激瘦自拍，整個人猶如紙片人般單薄。她在短短數月內憑藉極端飲食控制瘋狂減磅，體重出現驚人變化，更預告即將有新動向。這張面容略帶憔悴的近照瞬間引爆網絡熱議，揭開了她極致身形管理背後的殘酷真相。\n</p>\n<h2>杜如風曬照變紙片人曝光有大單嘢</h2>\n<p>日前杜如風在個人社交平台分享對鏡自拍照，畫面中她穿上鮮黃色短袖上衣配搭牛仔褲，四肢極度纖幼見骨，手臂更被形容為幼如火柴。對比以往圓潤飽滿的狀態，現時肚腩完全消失，身形單薄得彷彿一吹即散，體重由130磅狂跌至104磅。雖然她戴上大紅框眼鏡與冷帽作潮人打扮，但面容仍略顯蒼老憔悴，她更在帖文中寫下「呢扮靚！遲吓有大單嘢做，敬請留意！」，暗示正為下月開播有關首爾旅遊的新節目作準備。</p>\n<h2>首爾新節目開播前狂操體重跌至新低</h2>\n<p>面對外界對其急速消瘦狀態產生疑慮，杜如風接受傳媒訪問時大方解畫，並以堅定語氣向大眾派定心丸。她親自澄清指出「唔使擔心，我只係減肥」，透露經過大半年努力終於將體重減至達標水平，直言以前最瘦曾跌至90幾磅，但目前對104磅已經十分滿意。她再三強調「達標喇，唔會再瘦」，表明現時只想努力維持這個健康磅數，同時澄清絕對沒有依賴任何減肥藥物，單純靠節制飲食縮水。\n</p>\n<h2>昔日食類固醇暴肥自嘲身形肥過貨車</h2>\n<p>回顧這位旅遊達人的減肥史充滿血淚，早年她曾飽受嚴重濕疹問題困擾，在醫生建議下必須長期服用類固醇控制病情，副作用導致水腫與體重狂飆，當年她毫不避忌自嘲「肥過部貨車」。停藥後她下定決心重塑體態，最終摸索出一套適合自己的嚴格方案。她目前實行每日僅食一餐中午飯，確保攝取足夠營養，其餘時間若感飢餓只會進食烚蛋與納豆充飢，並堅持每日在跑步機跑足45分鐘，憑極強意志力擊退脂肪。</p>\n<h2>網民憂心暴瘦患厭食症湧入社交平台</h2>\n<p>社交平台留言區瞬間被大批關注其健康狀況的群眾瘋狂洗版，不少長期支持者對於她身形單薄大感震驚。大批網民紛紛湧入寫下「點樣可以瘦了那麼多？」以及「太瘦啦師姐」，更有部分人直言擔憂她是否因過度節食而患上厭食症，頻頻追問「會唔會瘦得滯呢？」。另一邊廂亦有持相反意見群眾力撐，認為以51歲之齡能夠展現出如此狀態實在難得，大讚她「唔似51歲」，更表示「一啲都唔覺得憔悴」，不同意見在網絡上不斷發酵。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298310274096195_20509914136adec03f170b0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"89BZDwXthulU4h-GgSpF42dQAOOnGXSsB3O02AdztNg.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298310274096195_20509914136adec03f170b0.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>極端自拍照曝光變紙片人（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169833441782852_15954088656acb259ee42ed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 流行東京 比起長髮新造型，杜如風明顯消瘦的身形更引起關注。（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169833441782852_15954088656acb259ee42ed.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>比起長髮新造型，杜如風明顯消瘦的身形更引起關注。（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298310665374994_2403067666adec0433717f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"toyufung_1778823138_3897372940719450121_22666316.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298310665374994_2403067666adec0433717f.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>今年5月嘅時候望落去狀態極好（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169835154965625_546834676acb25b0375cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 流行東京 （圖片來源：IG@toyufung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169835154965625_546834676acb25b0375cc.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169833630064005_21399819436acb25a2bc45d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 流行東京 有網民表示「瘦到完全認唔出」，對杜如風近況感到擔心。（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179169833630064005_21399819436acb25a2bc45d.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>有網民表示「瘦到完全認唔出」，對杜如風近況感到擔心。（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175817181045483410_209083041368cb92a2b547b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 流行東京 杜如風以往身形較圓潤，笑容爽朗，顯得精神奕奕。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/175817181045483410_209083041368cb92a2b547b.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>杜如風以往身形較圓潤，笑容爽朗，顯得精神奕奕。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-14 上午11.46.07.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8e%ad%e9%a3%9f%e7%97%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">厭食症</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">杜如風</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%9b%e8%82%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">減肥</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3529956\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.115624+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1529,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:28.231793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:46.213084+00:00","content_hash":"5c908cbe51ae491ee9f6745c20dcb0eef682fe138dfd309db5272fd8a132ad79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}